aro erupted with the Cataclysm, flooding the island with searing lava and sending tidal recoil sweeping through Kezan's harbors.\n\nThe playable goblin race experiences a phased instance of Kezan in their earliest levels before evacuating to the Lost Isles. Kezan is not reachable by other races or beyond these initial levels. Many of the denizens now live in Bilgewater Harbor in Azshara."},{n(-17,g({races=a0},{q(14138,{qgs={34668}}),q(14069,{sourceQuests={14138},qgs={34872}}),q(14075,{sourceQuests={14138},qgs={34872}}),q(25473,{sourceQuests={14069,14075},qgs={34872}}),q(28349,{sourceQuests={25473},qgs={34668}}),q(14071,{sourceQuests={28349},qgs={34874}}),q(24567,{sourceQuests={14071},qgs={34874}}),q(14070,{sourceQuests={14071},qgs={34668}}),q(26711,{sourceQuests={14071},qgs={35054}}),q(26712,{sourceQuests={14071},qgs={35053}}),q(14109,{sourceQuests={26712},qgs={35120}}),q(14110,{sourceQuests={26711},qgs={35120}}),q(24488,{sourceQuests={24567},qgs={37106}}),q(24502,{sourceQuests={24488},qgs={37106}}),q(24503,{sourceQuests={24502}}),q(28414,{sourceQuests={24502},qgs={37106}}),q(24520,{sourceQuests={24503,28414},qgs={37106}}),q(14153,{sourceQuests={14070,14110,24520},qgs={35054}}),q(14113,{sourceQuests={14070,14109,24520},qgs={35053}}),q(14115,{sourceQuests={14113,14153},qgs={34668}}),q(14116,{sourceQuests={14115},qgs={34668}}),q(14120,{sourceQuests={14116},qgs={35222}}),q(14122,{sourceQuests={14120},qgs={34668}}),q(14123,{sourceQuests={14120},qgs={34693}}),q(14121,{sourceQuests={14120},qgs={34874}}),q(14124,{sourceQuests={14120},qgs={34872}}),q(14125,{sourceQuests={14121,14122,14123,14124},qgs={34668}}),q(14126,{sourceQuests={14125},qgs={34668}})}))})),m(544,g({icon="Interface\\Icons\\achievement_femalegoblinhead",description="|cff66ccffThe Lost Isles are a chain of islands to the south of Azshara that the Bilgewater Cartel goblins reached after their shipwreck. Things get interesting when the orc ship Draka's Fury also crashes. This is a phased area that only levelin