ff66ccffStormheim is a zone in the eastern area of the Broken Isles situated in the shadow of Highmountain to the west, and Suramar to the southwest. It's home to the mighty vrykul who left Northrend many ages ago in search of their holy land. Two titanic watchers here have warred with each other for thousands of years. The Halls of Valor and Helheim, the realms to which the vrykul journey when they die, are located in this zone.|r",lvl=98},{ach(11139,g({description="WARNING! This achievement will be removed with the release of Battle For Azeroth. MAKE SURE TO FINISH IT BEFORE THEN!"},{title(340,g({description="WARNING! This title will be removed with the release of Battle For Azeroth. MAKE SURE TO GET IT BEFORE THEN!\n\nWARNING: You must drop or turn in duplicate quests otherwise you will be unable to loot anymore."},{crit(8,{qgs={108030},achievementID=11139,description="Vampirates.\n  - Crieve (This was the best farming spot by far.)",itemID=139531,b=1,f=104}),crit(13,{qgs={98498,98500,98501,98502,110258},achievementID=11139,description="Murlocs at Morheim (eastern Stormheim).",itemID=139529,b=1,f=104}),crit(14,{qgs={116600},achievementID=11139,description="Southern Stormheim.",itemID=139530,b=1,f=104})}))})),n(-25,{p(1708),p(1743),p(380),p(1712),p(647),p(550),p(645),p(1579),p(1583),p(1713),p(1744),p(633),p(1441),p(743),p(1749),p(1736),p(1917),p(1750),n(115742,g({description="1. Buy Pungent Vrykul Gamalost from Steward Dayton in Stormheim.\n2. Kill Direbeak Matriarch\n3. /target Orphaned Direbeak\n4. Feed Orphaned Direbeak Pungent Vrykul Gamalost.\n5. Enjoy new Direbeak Hatchling|r"},{p(1975),q(44982,{toy(142495,{b=1})}),q(44988,{mnt(213164,{itemID=137579,b=1,lvl=20})})}))}),n(-169,{q(42234,{i(157824,g({b=1,f=58},{n(-322,{s(80926,134202,{b=1,lvl=101,f=3})}),n(-3242,{s(77510,134216,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77515,134221,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77513,134219,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77516,134222,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77511,134217,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77509,134215,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4