 will yield 7-9 Seabottom Squid when killed. Note that this item only has a 1 minute duration in your bags, and it will disappear if you don't use it by then!",lvl=98},{n(102359,g({description="Drops 7-9 Seabottom Squid when killed."},{crit(13,{achievementID=10596,itemID=133741,b=1,f=56}),crit(13,{achievementID=10596,itemID=139668,b=1,f=56})}))}))}),i(133715,g({description="This item will give you a buff that will allow you to see and fish from Oodelfjisk schools.",lvl=98},{sp(201818,{crit(12,{achievementID=10596,itemID=133734,b=1,f=56}),crit(12,{achievementID=10596,itemID=139661,b=1,f=56})})})),i(133713,g({description="An important note - if you use this item with another bait active (or vice versa) the new buff WILL REPLACE the previous one! As such, it's best to wait until your bait buff expires before using this item. This does not apply to Arcane Lure, which can be used concurrently with any other bait/lure.",lvl=98},{i(133714)})),i(133714,g({description="This item will allow you to catch the Rare fish Thundering Stormray in Stormheim.",lvl=98},{crit(15,{achievementID=10596,itemID=133736,b=1,f=56}),crit(15,{achievementID=10596,itemID=139663,b=1,f=56})})),i(133716,g({description="This item will allow you to catch the Rare fish Graybelly Lobster in Stormheim.",lvl=98},{crit(7,{achievementID=10596,itemID=133735,b=1,f=56}),crit(7,{achievementID=10596,itemID=139662,b=1,f=56})}))}),ach(11725,{faction(2100,g({requireSkill=356,description="This Fisherfriend NPC is located at: |cFFFFFFFF90.5, 10.7|r on Shield's Rest.\n\nThe Fisherfriend NPC's will not always be up and only one is up at any given time.  You will have to either travel to the zone, ask a friend or check group finder to see if they are up.\n\nWhen fishing for the item for this particular fisherfriend make sure that you are close enough so that you recive the buff |cFFFFD700Something's Fishy|r, otherwise you won't be able to receive the turn-in items or the boss that is summoned.\n\nIt is recommended to be in a group in order to be able to reach Best Friend the quickest.",creatureID=120458},{i(146961,g({b=1,f=102},{toy(147307,{b=1}),toy(152574,{b=1})}))}))})}),prof(393,{n(91799,{r(194171,g({dr=17,collectible=false,itemID=139894,b=1,requireSkill=393},{r(194171)}))})})}),n(-34,{n(-322,{s(80926,134202,{b=1,lvl=101,f=3})}),n(-3242,g({icon="Interface\\Icons\\inv_helm_cloth_legionendgame_c_01"},{s(77510,134216,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77515,134221,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77513,134219,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77516,134222,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77511,134217,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77509,134215,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77512,134218,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4}),s(77514,134220,{b=1,lvl=101,f=4})})),n(-3266,g({icon="Interface\\Icons\\inv_helm_leather_legionendgame_c_01"},{s(77497,134196,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77499,134198,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77498,134197,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77493,134192,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77496,134195,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77500,134199,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77495,134194,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5}),s(77494,134193,{b=1,lvl=101,f=5})})),n(-3278,g({icon="Interface\\Icons\\inv_helmet_mail_legionendgame_c_01"},{s(77505,134211,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77507,134213,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77508,134214,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77502,134208,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77503,134209,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77501,134207,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77506,134212,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6}),s(77504,134210,{b=1,lvl=101,f=6})})),n(-3302,g({icon="Interface\\Icons\\inv_helm_plate_legionendgame_c_01"},{s(77486,134182,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77488,134184,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77483,134179,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77490,134186,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77484,134180,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77485,134181,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77487,134183,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(77489,134185,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7})})),n(-3309,g({icon="Interface\\Icons\\inv_helm_plate_legionendgame_c_01"},{s(78595,136728,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(78597,136730,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(78592,136725,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(78599,136732,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(78593,136726,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(78594,136727,{b=1,lvl=101,f=7}),s(78596,136729,