red to complete it. Note that this daily quest is randomly available among four other daily fishing quests."}),p(1448,{description="Can be bought from Nat Pagle in Garrison after becoming Good Friends for 50 Nat's Lucky Coin"}),p(340,{description="Can be fished from Darkmoon Island open water while the Darkmoon Faire is in town."}),p(173,{description="The [Bag of Fishing Treasures] that drops this pet can be obtained by completing the daily fishing quest [70]Crocolisks in the City. Level 70+ is required to obtain the quest, but a Fishing skill of 1+ is all that's required to complete it. Note that this daily quest is randomly available among four other daily fishing quests."}),p(211,{description="Can be looted Bag of Fishing Treasures or Bag of Shiny Things."}),p(1207,{description="This pet can be fished up from Jewel Danio Schools and Redbelly Mandarin Schools. Additionally, it can be caught by casting into the Fish of the Day in Townlong Steppes and the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Another way to obtain this pet is by fishing from inland open water in Townlong Steppes and the Vale of Eternal Blossoms."}),p(652,{description="This pet can be bought from Nat Pagle in Krasarang Wilds after obtaining The Anglers Honored Reputation for 200g."}),p(1208,{description="This pet can be fished up from Emperor Salmon Schools, Jade Lungfish Schools, and Krasarang Paddlefish Schools. Additionally, it can be caught by casting into the Fish of the Day in the Krasarang Wilds, The Jade Forest, and Valley of the Four Winds. Another way to obtain this pet is by fishing from inland open water in Krasarang Wilds, The Jade Forest, and Valley of the Four Winds. "}),p(1206,{description="This pet can be fished up from Spinefish Schools. Additionally, it can be caught by casting into the Fish of the Day in Kun-Lai Summit. Another way to obtain this pet is by fishing from open Sha-Touched water in Dread Wastes, Kun-Lai Summit, The Jade Forest (Widow's Wail only), and Townlong Steppes."}),p(1209,{description="This pet can be fished up from Giant Mantis Shrimp Swarms, Reef Octopus Swarms, and Tiger Gourami Schools. Additionally, it can be caught by casting into the Fish of the Day in the Dread Wastes, Kun-Lai Summit, and The Jade Forest. Another way to obtain this pet is by fishing in open water, mainly on the coast of most zones. For inland open water fishing, head to Kun-Lai Summit or The Veiled Stair."}),p(163,{description="The [Bag of Fishing Treasures] that drops this pet can be obtained by completing the daily fishing quest [70]Crocolisks in the City. Level 70+ is required to obtain the quest, but a Fishing skill of 1+ is all that's required to complete it. Note that this daily quest is randomly available among four other daily fishing quests."})}),n(-319,{i(34486,{description="Can be caught in Orgrimmar.",b=1,f=1}),i(34484,{description="Can be caught in Ironforge.",b=1,f=1}),s(2358,6360,{description="Can be caught in Darkmoon Island, Northern Stranglethorn, and Wetlands in open water.",b=2,lvl=20,f=23}),s(7794,19808,{description="Can be caught in The Cape of Stranglethorn or Northern Stranglethorn during the Stranglethorn Fishing Extravaganza from pools.",b=2,lvl=40,f=23}),s(21518,44505,{description="Can be caught in schools or open water in Northrend.",b=2,lvl=78,f=20}),s(21571,44703,{description="Can be caught from Fangtooth Herring Schools in Howling Fjord.",b=2,lvl=78,f=20})}),t(1),t(2),t(3),t(4),t(6),t(7,{faction(1975,g({description="Can be found on a floating island called Margoss' Retreat just North of Dalaran.\n\nIt is recommended to be in a group in order to be able to reach Best Friend the quickest.",requireSkill=356,creatureID=108825},{q(42911),i(138777,g({b=1,f=102},{mnt(214791,{itemID=138811,b=1,lvl=90}),toy(142532,{b=1}),toy(142531,{b=1}),p(1911,{itemID=138810}),p(2004,{itemID=143842,b=1})}))})),sp(201943,g({maps={1015,1017,1018,1021,1024,1033,1096}},{s(80800,139408,{b=2,lvl=101,f=4}),s(80798,139406,{b=2,lvl=101,f=5}),s(80799,139407,{b=2